{
  "id": "2542vko",
  "title": "CHAPTER 2: GEOGRAPHY OF ARUNACHAL PRADESH",
  "order": 3,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "sn9wkxl",
      "content": "Arunachal Pradesh is the largest state in Northeast India and the northernmost state of the country. It is known for its extraordinary geographical diversity, ranging from subtropical plains in the south to alpine meadows and perennial snowfields in the north."
    },
